      "family_id": "transfer.probabilistic_micro_kinetic",
      "title": "F3 — probabilistic microscopic-to-kinetic transfer",
      "description": "Kernel-check a conditional reduction for the fixed canonical random-mass lattice: from one explicit FullThermalizationCertificate containing a target RobustTwoTimeF2Certificate, the frozen threshold separation, and a matching canonical local-uniform KineticWindowApproximation along every admissible joint limit, derive high-probability two-sided g² T_eq bounds and the energy-density corollary. Construction of a target-model certificate remains a separate open research obligation; literature analogues are not accepted as exact-model proofs.",
